<http://www.semanticweb.org/marcusfifth/ontologies/2025/3/STRON> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/marcusfifth/ontologies/2025/3/STRON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "STRON is a Smart Tourism Recommendations Ontology designed to integrate data on events, hotels, restaurants, attractions, and transport within urban environments. It supports complex queries and inference via OWL restrictions and SWRL rules, enabling recommendations based on quality, affordability, temporal scheduling, and geographical proximity. STRON aims to facilitate data interoperability and enrich decision support in tourism applications"@en .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/marcusfifth/ontologies/2025/3/STRON> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "STRON: Smart Tourism Recommendations Ontology"@en .
